---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Wellbeing 108 — App di benessere guidato"
  description="App di benessere guidato con visualizzazioni immersive, respirazione sincronizzata, AI counselor e sessioni audio personalizzate. Disponibile su Android e iOS."
>
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-900 via-indigo-950 to-violet-950 text-white overflow-hidden">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
            <img src="/app/wellbeing-icon.png" alt="Wellbeing 108" class="w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl shadow-lg" />
            <div>
              <h1 class="text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold">Wellbeing 108</h1>
              <p class="text-violet-300 text-sm font-medium">by 108 Vision</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xl text-slate-200 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
            Trasforma il benessere quotidiano in un'esperienza guidata. Visualizzazioni immersive, respirazione sincronizzata e AI counselor — tutto in un'unica app.
          </p>
          <p class="text-slate-400 mb-8">
            Non un'ennesima app di meditazione. Un sistema completo che combina audio premium, esercizi di respirazione e intelligenza artificiale per creare sessioni personalizzate su misura per te.
          </p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4">
            <a href="#download" class="inline-flex items-center px-6 py-3 bg-white text-slate-900 font-semibold rounded-lg hover:bg-slate-100 transition-colors">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 mr-2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 16v1a3 3 0 003 3h10a3 3 0 003-3v-1m-4-4l-4 4m0 0l-4-4m4 4V4" /></svg>
              Scarica l'app
            </a>
            <a href="#features" class="inline-flex items-center px-6 py-3 border border-white/30 text-white font-semibold rounded-lg hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors">
              Scopri le funzionalita
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="hidden lg:block">
          <img src="/app/wellbeing-feature.png" alt="Wellbeing 108 App" class="w-full rounded-2xl shadow-2xl" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Problem/Solution -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-6">Il problema con le app di benessere</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 mb-12 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        La maggior parte delle app offre solo timer per la respirazione o podcast generici. Nessuna sincronizza davvero contenuti audio, esercizi di respiro e percorsi guidati in un'esperienza unica e personalizzata.
      </p>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
        <div class="p-6 bg-red-50 rounded-xl border border-red-100 text-left">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-3">App tradizionali</h3>
          <ul class="text-sm text-slate-600 space-y-2">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-red-400 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0">&#10005;</span>
              <span>Contenuti generici uguali per tutti</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-red-400 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0">&#10005;</span>
              <span>Timer respirazione scollegati dall'audio</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-red-400 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0">&#10005;</span>
              <span>Abbonamento mensile anche se usi poco</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-red-400 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0">&#10005;</span>
              <span>Nessuna personalizzazione AI reale</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 bg-green-50 rounded-xl border border-green-100 text-left">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-3">Wellbeing 108</h3>
          <ul class="text-sm text-slate-600 space-y-2">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-green-500 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0">&#10003;</span>
              <span>Sessioni costruite su misura dalla tua libreria</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-green-500 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0">&#10003;</span>
              <span>Respiro sincronizzato con audio e visualizzazioni</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-green-500 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0">&#10003;</span>
              <span>Pacchetti acquistabili — paghi solo quello che usi</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-green-500 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0">&#10003;</span>
              <span>AI Counselor che pianifica sessioni reali con i tuoi contenuti</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Features -->
  <section id="features" class="py-20 bg-slate-50">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="text-center mb-16">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">Cosa rende Wellbeing 108 diversa</h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-slate-600">Un'esperienza integrata, non un insieme di funzioni slegate.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        <div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-violet-100 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-violet-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 19V6l12-3v13M9 19c0 1.105-1.343 2-3 2s-3-.895-3-2 1.343-2 3-2 3 .895 3 2zm12-3c0 1.105-1.343 2-3 2s-3-.895-3-2 1.343-2 3-2 3 .895 3 2zM9 10l12-3" /></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-2">Sessioni Audio Immersive</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Pacchetti audio premium con stream, musiche e percorsi guidati. Scaricabili per uso offline completo.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-blue-100 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-blue-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M7 8h10M7 12h4m1 8l-4-4H5a2 2 0 01-2-2V6a2 2 0 012-2h14a2 2 0 012 2v8a2 2 0 01-2 2h-3l-4 4z" /></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-2">Respirazione Integrata</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Anello del respiro sincronizzato con la sessione. Non un timer separato — parte del flusso audio.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-amber-100 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-amber-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9.663 17h4.673M12 3v1m6.364 1.636l-.707.707M21 12h-1M4 12H3m3.343-5.657l-.707-.707m2.828 9.9a5 5 0 117.072 0l-.548.547A3.374 3.374 0 0014 18.469V19a2 2 0 11-4 0v-.531c0-.895-.356-1.754-.988-2.386l-.548-.547z" /></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-2">AI Counselor</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Testo e piano di sessione generati dall'AI usando solo contenuti della tua libreria. Con voce sintetizzata.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-emerald-100 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-emerald-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 12a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z" /><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M2.458 12C3.732 7.943 7.523 5 12 5c4.478 0 8.268 2.943 9.542 7-1.274 4.057-5.064 7-9.542 7-4.477 0-8.268-2.943-9.542-7z" /></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-2">AI Visualization</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">L'AI seleziona e combina i tuoi contenuti in un percorso personalizzato basato sul tuo stato d'animo.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-rose-100 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-rose-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 18h.01M8 21h8a2 2 0 002-2V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H8a2 2 0 00-2 2v14a2 2 0 002 2z" /></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-2">Offline-First</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Scarica i contenuti e usali ovunque. Lo stato personale resta sincronizzato quando torni online.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-indigo-100 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-indigo-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 6V4m0 2a2 2 0 100 4m0-4a2 2 0 110 4m-6 8a2 2 0 100-4m0 4a2 2 0 110-4m0 4v2m0-6V4m6 6v10m6-2a2 2 0 100-4m0 4a2 2 0 110-4m0 4v2m0-6V4" /></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-2">Pause Personalizzabili</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Contenuti davvero tuoi: ritmo, durata e combinazioni controllabili dentro percorsi narrativi acquistati.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- How it works -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-12 text-center">Come funziona</h2>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-8">
        <div class="text-center">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-violet-600 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4 text-xl font-bold">1</div>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-2">Scegli</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Esplora i pacchetti e acquista quelli che risuonano con te.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-violet-600 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4 text-xl font-bold">2</div>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-2">Scarica</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Download dei contenuti per uso offline, sempre disponibili.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-violet-600 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4 text-xl font-bold">3</div>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-2">Vivi</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Sessione guidata: audio + respiro + visual, tutto sincronizzato.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-violet-600 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4 text-xl font-bold">4</div>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-2">Evolvi</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">L'AI Counselor suggerisce sessioni sempre nuove dalla tua libreria.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- AI Section -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-gradient-to-br from-violet-50 to-indigo-50">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
        <div>
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-violet-600 uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">Intelligenza Artificiale Responsabile</p>
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-6">AI che lavora con i tuoi contenuti</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-600 mb-6">
            Il nostro AI Counselor non genera contenuti dal nulla. Usa esclusivamente la libreria di pacchetti che hai acquistato per creare piani di sessione personalizzati.
          </p>
          <ul class="space-y-3">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-violet-500 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
              <span class="text-slate-700">Pianificazione sessioni basata sul tuo catalogo</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-violet-500 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
              <span class="text-slate-700">Voce sintetizzata per guidance personalizzata</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-violet-500 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
              <span class="text-slate-700">Crediti senza scadenza — nessun abbonamento obbligatorio</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-violet-500 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
              <span class="text-slate-700">Santuario cloud: salva e rivivi le sessioni migliori</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-lg border border-slate-100">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-violet-100 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-violet-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9.663 17h4.673M12 3v1m6.364 1.636l-.707.707M21 12h-1M4 12H3m3.343-5.657l-.707-.707m2.828 9.9a5 5 0 117.072 0l-.548.547A3.374 3.374 0 0014 18.469V19a2 2 0 11-4 0v-.531c0-.895-.356-1.754-.988-2.386l-.548-.547z" /></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900 text-sm">AI Counselor</p>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-500">Sessione suggerita per oggi</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="space-y-3 text-sm text-slate-600">
            <div class="p-3 bg-slate-50 rounded-lg">
              <p class="font-medium text-slate-800 mb-1">Focus e concentrazione</p>
              <p class="text-xs">30 min — 3 stream + respirazione 4-7-8</p>
            </div>
            <div class="p-3 bg-slate-50 rounded-lg">
              <p class="font-medium text-slate-800 mb-1">Rilassamento serale</p>
              <p class="text-xs">20 min — 2 stream + respirazione lenta</p>
            </div>
            <div class="p-3 bg-violet-50 rounded-lg border border-violet-100">
              <p class="font-medium text-violet-800 mb-1">Visualizzazione creativa</p>
              <p class="text-xs text-violet-600">45 min — percorso completo con pausa personalizzata</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Pricing Model -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">Paghi solo quello che usi</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 mb-12">Nessun abbonamento obbligatorio. Acquista pacchetti e crediti AI quando vuoi.</p>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <div class="p-6 bg-slate-50 rounded-xl border border-slate-200">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-violet-100 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4 mx-auto">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-violet-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 19V6l12-3v13M9 19c0 1.105-1.343 2-3 2s-3-.895-3-2 1.343-2 3-2 3 .895 3 2zm12-3c0 1.105-1.343 2-3 2s-3-.895-3-2 1.343-2 3-2 3 .895 3 2zM9 10l12-3" /></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-2">Pacchetti Audio</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Stream, musiche e percorsi guidati. Acquista una volta, tieni per sempre.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 bg-violet-50 rounded-xl border border-violet-200">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-violet-200 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4 mx-auto">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-violet-700" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9.663 17h4.673M12 3v1m6.364 1.636l-.707.707M21 12h-1M4 12H3m3.343-5.657l-.707-.707m2.828 9.9a5 5 0 117.072 0l-.548.547A3.374 3.374 0 0014 18.469V19a2 2 0 11-4 0v-.531c0-.895-.356-1.754-.988-2.386l-.548-.547z" /></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-2">Crediti AI</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Crediti per sessioni AI Counselor e Visualization. Non scadono mai.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 bg-slate-50 rounded-xl border border-slate-200">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-amber-100 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4 mx-auto">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-amber-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M11.049 2.927c.3-.921 1.603-.921 1.902 0l1.519 4.674a1 1 0 00.95.69h4.915c.969 0 1.371 1.24.588 1.81l-3.976 2.888a1 1 0 00-.363 1.118l1.518 4.674c.3.922-.755 1.688-1.538 1.118l-3.976-2.888a1 1 0 00-1.176 0l-3.976 2.888c-.783.57-1.838-.197-1.538-1.118l1.518-4.674a1 1 0 00-.363-1.118l-3.976-2.888c-.784-.57-.38-1.81.588-1.81h4.914a1 1 0 00.951-.69l1.519-4.674z" /></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-2">Abbonamento Annuale</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Tutto incluso: tutti i pacchetti + AI illimitata + crediti mensili bonus.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Corporate Wellness -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-slate-50">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
        <div>
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-violet-600 uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">Per le aziende</p>
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-6">Corporate Wellness</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-600 mb-6">
            Wellbeing 108 supporta login enterprise-ready e gestione gruppi. Offri ai tuoi dipendenti uno strumento concreto per gestire stress e focus — non l'ennesimo benefit dimenticato.
          </p>
          <ul class="space-y-3 text-slate-700">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-violet-500 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
              <span>Onboarding team con sessioni guidate pre-configurate</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-violet-500 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
              <span>Dashboard utilizzo aggregato (anonimo)</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-violet-500 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
              <span>Pacchetti contenuti personalizzabili per settore</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-violet-500 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
              <span>SSO / SAML integrazione enterprise</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-lg border border-slate-100 text-center">
          <img src="/app/wellbeing-banner.png" alt="Wellbeing 108 Corporate" class="w-full rounded-lg mb-4" />
